WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The first song tells us this: if we take life seriously,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
we hope to find life’s truth and purpose.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
We hope not only to keep going, but to live better.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
In the end, we want to say: my life has meaning, purpose and value,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
and each day feels grounded. That is our hope.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
May our lives be a process of searching.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
I hope you can say today, “I found it,”

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
and “I did not leave empty-handed.”

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The second song points to a fact:

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
You and I are here. We exist.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Did we appear by chance, evolve from monkeys, or were we created by God?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
We will not debate that today. But we know that we are here.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Who am I? What is my worth? What is the purpose of my life?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.000
I hope we can find an answer that satisfies us.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Dear friends, I am nearing seventy. In a little over two years, I will be seventy.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.000
That makes me want to live each day with greater value.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:47.000
I hope the people I accompany and meet can say with me, “We found it.”
